The following directories of this repository contain code originally derived
from DIRUncertainty and adapted:

    - lib/Registration/   (PatchRegisterer + FixedMeanPatchRegisterer)
    - lib/dl_arch/        (UNet3D architecture under Model/ and Constants/)

